### Beskrivning av requesten
METOD url
Header: värde

body (om det behövs)


### Hämta alla bokningar
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings

### Skapa bokning
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Samantha",
  "email": "Samantha@claude.ai",
  "movieTitle": "Catz",
  "dateTime": "2026-11-08T20:30:00",
  "numberOfPeople": 2
}


### Hämta bokning med id
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/65ed9aaf-c833-46fc-bc19-8e6c835fde47


### Ändra bokning med id
PUT http://localhost:3000/bookings/65ed9aaf-c833-46fc-bc19-8e6c835fde47
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Samantha",
  "email": "Samantha@claude.ai",
  "movieTitle": "Catz",
  "dateTime": "2026-11-08T20:30:00",
  "numberOfPeople": 5,
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Ta bort bokning med id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/bookings/65ed9aaf-c833-46fc-bc19-8e6c835fde47
